{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52724","headline":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 六 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尾，九星如钩苍龙尾。\n下头五点号龟星，尾上天江四横是。\n尾东一个名傅说，傅说东畔一鱼子。\n龟西一室是神宫，所以列在后妃中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}